Package: econdatasets
Title: Easily Download 'EconDataverse' Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christoph", "Scheuch", , "christoph@tidy-intelligence.com", 
            role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
            comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-0423-6819"))
    )
Description: The 'EconDataverse' is a universe of open-source packages to work 
    seamlessly with economic data. This package is designed to make it easy to 
    download selected datasets that are preprocessed by 'EconDataverse' packages 
    and publicly hosted on 'Hugging Face'. Learn more about the 'EconDataverse' 
    at <https://www.econdataverse.org>.
